 "voice": "af_heart",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Here's how to write a check, like you're five.",
   "start": 0.12,
   "end": 2.14
  },
  {
   "text": "A check is a note to your bank that says: please give this person my money.",
   "start": 2.39,
   "end": 6.381
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot one, top right: today's date.",
   "start": 6.731,
   "end": 8.856
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot two: who gets the money. Write their name.",
   "start": 9.156,
   "end": 11.885
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot three: the amount in numbers. Squeeze it right up against the dollar sign,",
   "start": 12.185,
   "end": 16.772
  },
  {
   "text": "so this sneaky raccoon can't sneak an extra number in.",
   "start": 16.852,
   "end": 19.925
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot four: the same amount, in words. Twenty five, and fifty over one hundred.",
   "start": 20.275,
   "end": 24.996
  },
  {
   "text": "Then draw a line to the end, so nobody can add more.",
   "start": 25.146,
   "end": 28.03
  },
  {
   "text": "Secret: if the words and the numbers don't match, the bank usually trusts the words.",
   "start": 28.38,
   "end": 32.896
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot five, the memo: a little note that says what it's for. It's optional.",
   "start": 33.296,
   "end": 37.432
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot six, the big one: sign your name. No signature, no money.",
   "start": 37.732,
   "end": 41.544
  },
  {
   "text": "Always use a pen, and never sign a blank check. That's like handing the raccoon your piggy bank.",
   "start": 41.894,
   "end": 47.19
  },
  {
   "text": "The numbers at the bottom are your bank's name tag and your account number. Leave them alone.",
   "start": 47.54,
   "end": 52.314
  },
  {
   "text": "Six spots, and you just wrote a check. Which spot didn't you know?",
   "start": 52.664,
   "end": 56.082
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow for more grown-up stuff, explained like you're five.",
   "start": 56.382,
   "end": 59.541
  },
  {
   "text": "So next time someone says, just write me a check...",
   "start": 59.791,
   "end": 62.384
  }
 ],
